01:26:47,460 --> 01:26:50,390
(You want us to leave?)

2083
01:26:51,130 --> 01:26:52,130
(It was really hard.)

2084
01:26:52,130 --> 01:26:53,900
(I regret it even to this day.)

2085
01:26:55,230 --> 01:26:57,570
(It Was Chobok)

2086
01:26:58,530 --> 01:26:59,940
(It's been a while.)

2087
01:27:01,300 --> 01:27:03,270
(This is Shanghai.)

2088
01:27:03,810 --> 01:27:08,210
(A place filled with memories from Ji Hyeon's childhood)

2089
01:27:08,810 --> 01:27:11,910
(My old neighborhood I came back to after a long time)

2090
01:27:13,010 --> 01:27:15,150
(This street looks the same.)

2091
01:27:15,450 --> 01:27:17,450
(Hey, that's my school!)

2092
01:27:18,090 --> 01:27:19,920
(He enters his old school excitedly.)

2093
01:27:20,820 --> 01:27:22,490
(I can't believe I'm back here.)

2094
01:27:22,720 --> 01:27:24,190
(Smiling bashfully)

2095
01:27:25,030 --> 01:27:28,130
(Jumping like the little child he was 20 years ago)

2096
01:27:29,330 --> 01:27:32,330
(He trudges on, leaving behind an armful of memories.)

2097
01:27:34,300 --> 01:27:35,440
What is this?

2098
01:27:36,600 --> 01:27:38,770
(What is everyone doing out here?)

2099
01:27:39,870 --> 01:27:41,680
(Is this where people get married?)

2100
01:27:41,680 --> 01:27:43,210
(It's where they have blind dates.)

2101
01:27:43,910 --> 01:27:44,950
(I can meet someone...)

2102
01:27:44,950 --> 01:27:46,510
(if I want to?)

2103
01:27:46,780 --> 01:27:48,420
(Which year were you born?)

2104
01:27:48,820 --> 01:27:50,620
(Is this what you're looking for?)

2105
01:27:50,920 --> 01:27:52,850
(A sudden chance to get married?)

2106
01:27:53,050 --> 01:27:55,290
(- Where are you from? - From Korea.)

2107
01:27:55,760 --> 01:27:59,430
(Suddenly singing "Arirang")

2108
01:28:00,930 --> 01:28:03,770
(A surprise serenade he didn't even request?)

2109
01:28:04,730 --> 01:28:07,980
(Shanghai Once Again)
